投资而言，这个方向性很多时候具有实质性意义。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "chapterUid": 11, "content": "所以林园干消费理论上是没有问题的啊。因为财富分配改善，中国老百姓一定是越来越有钱，人均GDP是越来越高的，即使眼前体感很差，但是长期趋势就是变得有钱，消费一定会起来", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "5113-5161", "createTime": 1785675036, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 11, "reviewId": "426066534_8b3Of9RtC", "userVid": 426066534, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}}, "commentsCount": 3, "hotComments": []}]}, {"range": "5303-5352", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 2, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "223635575_8ceoZgggM", "review": {"abstract": "奥尔森从社会调和的角度出发，提出了打破制度刚性的改良理论，他的公共选择理论诠释了如何打破制度刚性", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterUid": 11, "content": "怎么破？要么建立在自愿之上，要么在暴力之下，或者基于公平规则", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "5303-5351", "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterName": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "chapterIdx": 11, "reviewId": "223635575_8ceoZgggM",